3498601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Soul-Based Progression</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instead of linear upgrades, players enhance their attributes by collecting souls. Failing to collect them empowers the enemy instead, creating a balance-of-power mechanic represented as a scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885370/extras/938ea1c49244ffc66124de6790e222bf.poster.avif?t=1753498601\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885370/extras/938ea1c49244ffc66124de6790e222bf.webm?t=1753498601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885370/extras/938ea1c49244ffc66124de6790e222bf.mp4?t=1753498601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Boss Battles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each boss features unique attack patterns and mechanics that challenge the player\u2019s reflexes. Defeating a boss unlocks new abilities, further expanding combat possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885370/extras/abe847ca1e1335589f3f374aad4d66e0.poster.avif?t=1753498601\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885370/extras/abe847ca1e1335589f3f374aad4d66e0.webm?t=1753498601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885370/extras/abe847ca1e1335589f3f374aad4d66e0.mp4?t=1753498601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","developers":["SpringBone"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3774410","name